{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，郁闷……」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3561", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6478", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女人就是麻烦」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3562", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第二天早上，教室里鸦雀无声。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原因很简单。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「濑名和小乾的负面情绪蔓延至全班了啊」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": "「濑名和小乾的负面情绪蔓延至全班了啊」", "plain_idx": 212, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1708", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，她俩本来影响力就强」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "加之一直元气满满的安洁今天也很安静。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刚才在走廊碰见时，\\n她甚至面露恐惧地尖叫着逃跑了。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "刚才在走廊碰见时，她甚至面露恐惧地尖叫着逃跑了。", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一时间我还以为我的脸上沾了点什么东西，\\n但事实并非如此。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "一时间我还以为我的脸上沾了点什么东西，但事实并非如此。", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜～这种时候就应该去活动室看看小动物们治愈治愈」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": "「呜～这种时候就应该去活动室看看小动物们治愈治愈」", "plain_idx": 220, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3563", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「记得上课前要回来哦？」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6479", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好，顺便把沙包带过去」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3564", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说罢纱凪一把拉住我的手臂。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是沙包？」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还能是谁？」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3565", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也就新吾了啊？」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1709", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一到这种时候就倒戈，\\n薄情的隼太冲我摆着手道别。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": "一到这种时候就倒戈，薄情的隼太冲我摆着手道别。", "plain_idx": 233, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拳打？还是脚踢？还是耳光？」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3566", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有其他选项了啊」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「正常来说有人会亲沙包吗？」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3567", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不会吧」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以说嘛」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3568", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪满足地笑着，一脚踩在我的鞋上。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沙包，我们走」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3569", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便被她如此称呼依然还感到高兴的我，\\n或许在各种意义上都已经无可救药了吧……", "text_idx": 245, "plain": "即便被她如此称呼依然还感到高兴的我，或许在各种意义上都已经无可救药了吧……", "plain_idx": 246, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还得是这里最让人舒心。\\n　待在教室里真是累人」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": "「还得是这里最让人舒心。　待在教室里真是累人」", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3570", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是么？」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今早一进教室黄色的尖叫声就此起彼伏，\\n　大家都说什么“纱纱，听说你被瓜生公主抱了？好羡慕～！”」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "「今早一进教室黄色的尖叫声就此起彼伏，　大家都说什么“纱纱，听说你被瓜生公主抱了？好羡慕～！”」", "plain_idx": 252, "len": 50, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3571", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我姑且为你作了开脱，\\n　要是突然来找你造成误会就麻烦了」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "「我姑且为你作了开脱，　要是突然来找你造成误会就麻烦了」", "plain_idx": 255, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3572", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用在意我的」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以在这里就不用在意别人了。\\n　话说我肚子痛得好想死」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": "「所以在这里就不用在意别人了。　话说我肚子痛得好想死」", "plain_idx": 259, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3573", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种时候的男性最是手足无措的。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但坚强的纱凪竟然会示弱，\\n想必确实难受。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": "但坚强的纱凪竟然会示弱，想必确实难受。", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「穿上这个吧，注意不要让身体着凉了」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、喂，你的衣服你自己穿。\\n　这么温柔的话我会……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": "「啊、喂，你的衣服你自己穿。　这么温柔的话我会……」", "plain_idx": 266, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3574", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话还没说完，纱凪的眼眸泛起泪花。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了，纱凪？！」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪意外的反应让我有些乱了阵脚，\\n我赶紧来到她的身边。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": "纱凪意外的反应让我有些乱了阵脚，我赶紧来到她的身边。", "plain_idx": 271, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不，我只是感觉松了口气」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3575", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「其实今天早上我跟理央吵了一架，\\n　我本来肚子疼着呢，\\n　理央还说出了不管动物死活这种话……」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "「其实今天早上我跟理央吵了一架，　我本来肚子疼着呢，　理央还说出了不管动物死活这种话……」", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 49, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3576", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来平时的压力终于爆发了。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "看来平时的压力终于爆发了。", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪任由泪水留下，\\n紧紧抓着我的衣襟。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": "纱凪任由泪水留下，紧紧抓着我的衣襟。", "plain_idx": 280, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还是很担心理央。\\n　本该向父母撒娇的年纪，现在他却只能孤零零地待在家中」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "「我还是很担心理央。　本该向父母撒娇的年纪，现在他却只能孤零零地待在家中」", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3577", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就连考虑事情的思路也与一般孩子不同……」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3578", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道他不喜欢动物，\\n　但想让动物们死，不是这个年纪该说的话吧？」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": "「我知道他不喜欢动物，　但想让动物们死，不是这个年纪该说的话吧？」", "plain_idx": 287, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3579", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我理解纱凪的担忧。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我不清楚理央说的这些话是否出自本心。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "之前和他交谈时，\\n我感觉他是个担心姐姐身体的温柔孩子。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": "之前和他交谈时，我感觉他是个担心姐姐身体的温柔孩子。", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我没办法向纱凪解释这一点，这让我倍感焦急。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好险，差点被新吾弄哭了」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3580", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我要是那么做会被勒死的」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那只是我随便说说的……」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3581", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪擦了擦眼角，背过身去掩饰住了自己的表情。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「肚子还好吗？」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3582", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那坐过来？」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我特意不再继续谈论理央的事情，\\n现在我只担心纱凪的身体。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "我特意不再继续谈论理央的事情，现在我只担心纱凪的身体。", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜……感觉距离突然缩短了……」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3583", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "曾经，我哮喘发作严重时，\\n经常以揉搓背部来缓解。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "曾经，我哮喘发作严重时，经常以揉搓背部来缓解。", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样做可以让心情平静，痛苦也能得到缓解。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": "这样做可以让心情平静，痛苦也能得到缓解。", "plain_idx": 310, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这次我也打算试试。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「男生对你做这种事可能会让你反感……」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "「男生对你做这种事可能会让你反感……」", "plain_idx": 312, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，什么？等等，\\n　你在摸哪……呜啊？！」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": "「哎，什么？等等，　你在摸哪……呜啊？！」", "plain_idx": 314, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3584", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我将手掌轻放在纱凪的小腹上，开始上下揉动。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪看来是吓着了，\\n红着脸僵在了原地。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "纱凪看来是吓着了，红着脸僵在了原地。", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样揉一揉也许会让你舒服点？」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哪有突然揉别人小腹的啊……」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": "「哪有突然揉别人小腹的啊……」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3585", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说实话，我都已经做好被你踢飞的心理准备了」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3586", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，疼吗？」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不是，刚才的声音是不自觉发出来的……」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": "「啊，不是，刚才的声音是不自觉发出来的……」", "plain_idx": 326, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3587", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过你还挺熟练的啊？\\n　不会对爱理她们也做过吧……」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "「不过你还挺熟练的啊？　不会对爱理她们也做过吧……」", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3588", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有没有。\\n　我也是第一次对女孩做这种事」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": "「没有没有。　我也是第一次对女孩做这种事」", "plain_idx": 332, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也……第一次被人碰小腹……」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3589", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "极近距离下我们的眼神交汇，彼此都说不出话来。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要纱凪稍有抵触，我就打算放弃的。\\n意外的是她安心地依偎着我。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": "只要纱凪稍有抵触，我就打算放弃的。意外的是她安心地依偎着我。", "plain_idx": 337, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉疼痛真的缓解了……」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3590", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是么？有效果就好」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……真是搞不懂男的」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3591", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天公主抱时那么拼命，\\n　但现在却判若两人……」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "「昨天公主抱时那么拼命，　但现在却判若两人……」", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3592", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「肚子疼时又那么温柔，\\n　让人根本气不起来……」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": "「肚子疼时又那么温柔，　让人根本气不起来……」", "plain_idx": 347, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3593", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还有，脸凑太近了。你故意的吧」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": "「还有，脸凑太近了。你故意的吧」", "plain_idx": 349, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3594", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "终于纱凪开始反抗，我便将手抽了回来。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是纱凪站起背过身去，\\n低着头摸着自己的肚子。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": "于是纱凪站起背过身去，低着头摸着自己的肚子。", "plain_idx": 353, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可恶，又被你夺走第一次了……」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3595", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不光是公主抱，\\n　就连抚摸肚子也……」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": "「不光是公主抱，　就连抚摸肚子也……」", "plain_idx": 357, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3596", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看来沙包该出场了」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「烦人，就算把你当成沙包打，\\n　我的第一次也回不来了」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": "「烦人，就算把你当成沙包打，　我的第一次也回不来了」", "plain_idx": 361, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3597", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有朝一日我会报仇的」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3598", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「报、报仇？」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然做不到对你公主抱，\\n　但把你从头到尾乱摸一通还是可以的」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": "「虽然做不到对你公主抱，　但把你从头到尾乱摸一通还是可以的」", "plain_idx": 367, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3599", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算你道歉也晚了。\\n　就算你哭喊着求我也不会停手，\\n　我要让你知道我的可怕」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": "「就算你道歉也晚了。　就算你哭喊着求我也不会停手，　我要让你知道我的可怕」", "plain_idx": 370, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3600", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "面对莫名燃起复仇心的纱凪，我有些无奈。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为这对我来说不是复仇，而是奖励，\\n不过这话打死我我也说不出口。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": "因为这对我来说不是复仇，而是奖励，不过这话打死我我也说不出口。", "plain_idx": 374, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0251", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜？」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0596", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你就是熊喵啊」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0252", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～？」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0597", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0253", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我可不会忘记，你对我的背叛」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0254", "char_id": "理央"}]}
